        <item>
            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string>Run live tests on ERP5 Test Components and return results.\n
\n
    ⚠ DESTRUCTIVE: well-written ERP5 tests run inside a transaction that\n
    gets rolled back, but this is a convention, not a guarantee. Tests can\n
    commit early, mutate configuration that persists outside the transaction,\n
    or leave artifacts. Treat as state-changing.\n
\n
    Executes unit tests directly on the ERP5 instance via the ComponentTool.\n
    Tests run synchronously — the call blocks until all tests complete.\n
    Can take a long time for large test suites.\n
\n
    USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - You want to run tests on a Test Component after making changes.\n
    - You want to verify a specific test method passes.\n
    - You need to check test output for debugging.\n
\n
    PREREQUISITE: Search portal_components for Test Components to find valid\n
    test_list values (use the component\'s reference, not its full ID).\n
    </string> </value>
